    "id": "guid-a516812e7372ee54",
    "kind": "prose",
    "template": "Save a compact private account-owned resume checkpoint in this model or agent scope before interruption or handoff. Optional understanding keeps self-explanations, exact support/check-report locators, questions and next steps; peer reports do not certify independent evidence. Existing understanding requires checkpoint expectedRevision on update; omission preserves it and [] explicitly clears it. learningProgress snapshots a bounded MOC route; pendingEdits preserves edit guards and researchTrail short findings. Resume to revalidate and reread after saving. No passwords, tokens, bodies, prompts, hidden reasoning, execution authority or automatic account transfer.",
